        "id": "2108680107737190575",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "David Goldman",
        "text": "ANATEL and @Baigorri1984  just delivered for the people of Brazil. 🇧🇷🎇 Starlink Mobile will use these priority spectrum rights to make sure all Brazilians have access to high-speed mobile broadband, from small fishing villages to the remote regions of the Amazon. 🛰️🤳📶",
