            "width": 1080
          }
        ],
        "name": "As Found",
        "text": "🚨 ELON MUSK ON INTERNET AND POVERTY\n\nElon said the single biggest thing you can do to lift people out of poverty is give them an internet connection.\n\nOnce people have internet, they can learn almost anything for free and sell their goods and services to the world.\n\nSpaceX is in a strong position. It will likely do about 90% of the mass launched to orbit this year, and nearly 80% of all active satellites in orbit are already SpaceX, providing high-bandwidth connectivity worldwide. https://x.com/XFreeze/status/2015067284205916553/video/1",
