      "text": "BREAKING: SpaceX donated nearly $500,000 to Anderson-Shiro CISD in Texas for 3 new school buses with three-point seatbelts, cameras and radios.\n\nThe donation will help upgrade the district’s fleet and give students safer rides. ❤️",
